"_: NAME OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your names"
msgstr "Heiko Evermann, Sönke Dibbern"

#: _translatorinfo.cpp:3
msgid ""
"_: EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your emails"
msgstr "heiko@evermann.de, s_dibbern@web.de"

#: email.cpp:85
msgid "KDE Email Control Module"
msgstr "KDE Kuntrullmoduul för de Nettpost"

#: email.cpp:86
msgid "Configure your identity, email addresses, mail servers, etc."
msgstr "Instellen vun dien Identiteet, Nettpostadressen, Nettpostservers, usw."

#: email.cpp:88
msgid "Current maintainer"
msgstr "pleegt dat vundaag"

#: email.cpp:191
msgid "New Email Profile"
msgstr "Nieg Nettpostprofil"

#: email.cpp:198
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "Naam:"

#: email.cpp:219
msgid "Please enter a name for the profile."
msgstr "Bitte giff en Naam för dat Profil an."

#: email.cpp:221
msgid "This email profile already exists, and cannot be created again."
msgstr "Dit Nettpostprofil gifft dat al, un dat lett sik nich nochmaal maken."

#: email.cpp:295
msgid ""
"<h1>Email</h1> This module allows you to enter basic email information for the "
"current user. The information here is used, among other things, for sending bug "
"reports to the KDE developers when you use the bug report dialog.<p> "
"Note that email programs like KMail offer many more features, but they provide "
"their own configuration facilities."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Nettpost</h1> In dit Moduul köönt de Hööft-Nettpostdaten för den aktuellen "
"Bruker ingeven warrn. Disse Daten warrt - blang anner - dorför bruukt, "
"Fehlerberichten över dat Fehlerbericht-Formulor to de Schrieverslüüd vun KDE to "
"schicken.<p> Nettpost-Programmen as KMail hebbt en Reeg mehr Mööglichkeiten, "
"aver se hebbt ok ehr egen Instellen."

#: email.cpp:314
msgid "Do you wish to discard changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "Wullt Du dat, wat bi dit Profil verännert is, vergeten?"

#: email.cpp:315
msgid "Do you wish to save changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "Wullt Du dat, wat an dit Profil verännert is, sekern?"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Nettpost"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "User Information"
msgstr "Brukerinformatschoon"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"You can set a reply address if you want replies to your email messages to go to "
"a different address than the email address above. Most likely, you should leave "
"the reply address blank, so replies go to the email address you entered "
"above.<p><em> Please note:</em> <ul><li>You do not need to enter the same email "
"address as above.</li><li>You should not use a reply address if you frequently "
"use discussion mailing lists.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst en Antwoortadress fastleggen, wenn Antwoorden op diene Nettbreven "
"to'n annere Adress schickt warrn schöölt as de Adress baven. In de Regel kannst "
"Du dat Feld leddig laten, denn warrt Antwoorden an de Adress schickt, de Du "
"baven ingeven hest.<p><em> Mark op:</em> <ul><li>Dat deit nich nödig, de sülve "
"Adress as baven nochmaal intogeven.</li><li>Wenn Du faken op Nettpost-Listen "
"schriffst, schullst du keen Antwoortadress ingeven.</li></ul>"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"Enter your email address here, e.g. \"john@doe.com\" (without the quotation "
"marks). This information is mandatory if you want to use email.<p>\n"
"Do <em>not</em> enter something like John Doe &lt;john@doe.com&gt;\", just a "
"plain email address. Your email address must not contain any blank spaces."
msgstr ""
"Giff dien Nettpost-Adress hier in, t.B. \"klaas@achterndiek.de\" (ahn de "
"Anföhren-Teken). De Adress muttst du ingeven, anners kannst keen Nettpost "
"bruken.<p>\n"
"Bitte <em>nich</em> so wat as \"Klaas Achterndiek "
"&lt;klaas@achterndiek.de&gt;\" ingeven, bloots en rene Nettpost-Adress. Dor "
"dörv keen Leerteken binnen de Adress wesen."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Organi&zation:"
msgstr "Organi&satschoon:"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Reply-&to address:"
msgstr "Ant&woortadress:"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid ""
"Here you can enter the name of your organization, company or university. This "
"field is <em>optional</em>. However, if you are using a business account and "
"communicate with persons working for other companies, providing the name of "
"your organization is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst den Naam vun dien Organisatschoon, Firma oder Universiteet ingeven. "
"Dat Feld is <em>optschonaal</em>. Wenn du aver för'n Bedrief an Lüüd schriffst, "
"de för annere Bedrieven arbeiden, is dat beter, den Naam vun dien "
"Organisatschoon antogeven."

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "E&mail address:"
msgstr "&Nettpostadress:"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Enter your full name here, e.g. \"John Doe\" (without the quotation\n"
"marks). Some people like to provide a nickname only. You can leave this field "
"blank and still use email. However, providing your full name is <em>"
"recommended</em> as this makes it much easier for your recipient to browse his "
"or her email."
msgstr ""
"Hier bitte dien heel Naam ingeven, t.B. \"Klaas Achterndiek\" (ahn de "
"Anföhrensteken). Welk Lüüd geven ok bloots en Ökelnaam an. Nettpost kann ok "
"bruukt warrn, wenn dat Feld leddig blifft, aver dat is <em>anraadt</em>"
", en Naam intogeven, as dat för den Adressaat bannig wat lichter warrt, dör "
"sien egen oder Dien Nettbreven to stövern."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Full &name:"
msgstr "&Heel Naam:"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "SMTP server:"
msgstr "SMTP-Server:"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"<qt>You can specify the server to send mail to here.\n"
"<br><br> SMTP means Simple Mail Transfer Protocol and is the standard way to "
"send mail.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Du kannst den Server, to den de Nettpost schickt warrn schall, hier "
"ingeven.\n"
"<br><br> SMTP bedüüdt \"Simple Mail Transfer Protocol\" (d.b. Eenfach "
"Post-Överdregenprotokoll) un is de Standardmetood, Nettpost to sennen.</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "C&urrent profile:"
msgstr "&Aktuell Profil:"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "&New Profile..."
msgstr "&Nieg Profil..."
